    "scenesThatPass": [
      "AGNIS: I was born here.\nBUNNY: The green makes me hurl. Her, too.\nAGNIS: Empty 44 years. And look at that roofline, straight as a ruler.",
      "AGNIS: Up those stairs, Aunt Pinkie slept. So fat she couldn't get down to her chamber pot. Wanna see if she's still there?\nAGNIS: Well. Too late to drive that road back 'round the bay. We'll camp in here tonight. Be right as rain.\nBUNNY: Which one's Petal's room? I'll sleep there.",
      "AGNIS: Gonna chat up yer daughter, or just ignore her as usual?\nBUNNY: Warren threw up in your sleeping bag. She's got a stomach problem.",
      "BUNNY: First is the teaching part. The learning comes later.\nBUNNY: Wavey? Now are the berries ready to pick?\nPETAL: Want to pick my berries, do you. Should I climb right up on this sink?\nWAVEY: Almost. Almost ready. You know, it's all about timing.",
      "BUNNY: Then don't. Slow us. Down.\nWAVEY: I want us. To be friends, okay?\nWAVEY: And friends. Need. To understand each other."
    ]
  },
